=================== WHAT IS AND IS NOT ESTABLISHED ===================

ESTABLISHED: the Ir and call counts above on byte-identical cells; the wall
clock on the listed cells at 21 paired rounds; that the two tables agree with
the `match`es they replaced on all 25 power-of-two shapes; that the heap does
not move.
NOT ESTABLISHED: any preset but 2 / 6 / 10, any qp but 40, any size but 256 and
512, 10-bit, the inter/video arm's wall clock. The remaining out-of-line
helper the realimg record named is `palette::palette_color_index_context`
(2,961,716 calls / 211.6 M Ir = 1.5 % of a SCREENSHOT's p2, C's
`av1_fast_palette_color_index_context` being `static inline`); it is on screen
content only and was not touched here.
